# Play test of The Kraken's Wake (CIPlay krakens_wake, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the first
# islet's lookout (its legs round -86 -30 on a pad at 4.6 m, the ladder at -86 -27.1, the deck 11.1 m), the warning at its
# foot (-86 -25); the fishers' hut on the second islet's south shore (x -8.25..-3.75, z -34.25..-29.75); the wake along the
# reef's south side - the Sparrowhawk (-72 -52, 8 m), the Grey Heron (-42 -54, 10 m), the Corsair (-10 -52, 13 m), the Tern
# (22 -48, 17 m), the Sovereign (52 -44, 21 m) - and the trench (30 m) from 62 -40 to 94 -24; the battery on the last
# islet's south-east rock (pad 5 m): the platform's deck 8 m, its ladders at 66.3 -11.2, the gun at 66.3 -13
island The Kraken's Wake
offset 0.6508 -0.4589
expect step 0
expect title The Wake
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden kraken
wait 5

# The first islet: up the lookout's ladder onto its deck; the warning at its foot; the box on the deck
walk -86 -21 to -86 -25.8 h=4.6
climb -86 -27.1 h=4.6
walk -86 -28.3 to -86 -30 h=11.1 below=13
zone lookout
expect step 1
open Lookout box
read Fisherfolk's warning
expect step 2

# The fishers' hut on the second islet
open Fishers' box

# Down the wake: the Sparrowhawk; the captains' chests; the first two gunners' chests; the barrels
zone wreck1
expect step 3
open Sparrowhawk's captain's chest
open Barrel in the wake
open Grey Heron's captain's chest
open Grey Heron's gunner's chest
open Corsair's captain's chest
open Corsair's gunner's chest
open Tern's captain's chest
expect story logpage 4
expect step 4
open Barrel in the deep wake
expect story harpoonpart 2

# The battery on the last islet: up its ladders onto the platform; the gun needs all three parts
walk 60 -4 to 64 -7.5 to 66.3 -9.6 h=5
climb 66.3 -11.2 h=5
climb 66.3 -11.2 h=6.2
walk 66.3 -11.9 to 65.5 -12.4 h=8 below=10
use harpoon
expect message nothing on it
# (the third part from the Tern's gunner's chest; back at the battery, the gunner's log)
open Tern's gunner's chest
expect story harpoonpart 3
# (the battery's zone, entered before, counts at once)
expect step 6
read Battery gunner's log
expect step 7

# The harpoon armed: lights rise in the trench; the dive; the Kraken and its brood; the admiral's sea chest
open Admiral's sea chest
expect message pinned
use harpoon
expect story harpoonpart 0
expect shown kraken
expect shown brood
zone lair
expect step 8
kill Angler fish
expect step 9
open Admiral's sea chest
expect item Blueprint_Recycler 1
expect done
